\n\n\n</aside>\n\nTerracotta is one of the many rock nodes that are found in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>.  These nodes are found in a cave located towards the left of <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>, or under the bridges in the Oke Desert. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ore\">Ore</span></h2>\n<p>The chart below displays all possible ore that spawns within this node.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7a/BetterNewInkStone.png/revision/latest?cb=20230314120721\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"BetterNewInkStone\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"122\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BetterNewInkStone.png\" data-image-key=\"BetterNewInkStone.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7a/BetterNewInkStone.png/revision/latest?cb=20230314120721\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Pyrite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230116213834\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Pyrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pyrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Pyrite.